    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to \"check in\" with something that isn't there. everything feels so performative. like i'm just playing a character of someone who's still alive, but there's no substance behind it anymore. people still interact with me, but they're talking to a memory. it just feels like i'm wasting everyone's time by staying in this loop.",
